00:58:07,901 --> 00:58:11,469
HERCULES ! HERCULES ! HERCULES !

1010
00:58:21,815 --> 00:58:24,549
[ MAN SCREAMING ]

1011
00:58:28,088 --> 00:58:30,621
OH !

1012
00:58:36,496 --> 00:58:39,564
AAH !

1013
00:59:34,521 --> 00:59:38,635
HANS ! PLEASE , HANS !

1014
00:59:38,659 --> 00:59:40,025
AAH !

1015
00:59:45,799 --> 00:59:47,098
AAH !

1016
00:59:48,134 --> 00:59:51,848
HOW SHE GOT THAT WAY WILL NEVER BE KNOWN .

1017
00:59:51,872 --> 00:59:54,150
SOME SAY A JEALOUS LOVER .

1018
00:59:54,174 --> 00:59:59,656
OTHERS , THAT IT WAS THE CODE OF THE FREAKS .

1019
00:59:59,680 --> 01:00:02,659
OTHERS , THE STORM .

1020
01:00:02,683 --> 01:00:06,328
BELIEVE IT OR NOT , THERE SHE IS .

1021
01:00:06,352 --> 01:00:10,722
[ SQUAWKING ]

1022
01:00:18,699 --> 01:00:21,678
BUT , SIR , THEY INSIST ON SEEING YOU .

1023
01:00:21,702 --> 01:00:25,347
IN ALL THESE YEARS , I 'VE SEEN NO ONE .

1024
01:00:25,371 --> 01:00:27,316
HAVE I NOT TOLD YOU THAT ?

1025
01:00:27,340 --> 01:00:29,118
SEND THEM AWAY .

1026
01:00:29,142 --> 01:00:31,020
VERY GOOD , SIR .

1027
01:00:31,044 --> 01:00:33,056
I CAN 'T SEE NO ONE .

1028
01:00:33,080 --> 01:00:35,357
EXCUSE ME , SIR . YOU CAN 'T COME IN .

1029
01:00:35,381 --> 01:00:37,560
CAN 'T I ? WHO 'S GOING TO STOP ME ?

1030
01:00:37,584 --> 01:00:38,895
I HAVE MY ORDERS .

1031
01:00:38,919 --> 01:00:40,496
WELL , I 'M IN , AIN 'T I ?

1032
01:00:40,520 --> 01:00:42,531
OH , YES , YOU CAN , HANSIE , OLD BOY .

1033
01:00:42,555 --> 01:00:44,366
THERE 'S SOMEONE YOU 'VE JUST GOT TO SEE .

1034
01:00:44,390 --> 01:00:47,670
WHY DID YOU COME HERE ?

1035
01:00:47,694 --> 01:00:52,308
PLEASE , HANS , DON 'T BE ANGRY .

1036
01:00:52,332 --> 01:00:56,813
VENUS AND PHROSO HAVE BEEN SO KIND BY ME .

1037
01:00:56,837 --> 01:00:59,983
PLEASE , GO AWAY .

1038
01:01:00,007 --> 01:01:02,774
I CAN 'T SEE NO ONE .

1039
01:01:04,911 --> 01:01:08,925
BUT , HANS , YOU TRIED TO STOP THEM .

1040
01:01:08,949 --> 01:01:12,929
IT WAS ONLY THE POISON YOU WANTED .

1041
01:01:12,953 --> 01:01:16,254
IT WASN 'T YOUR FAULT .

1042
01:01:17,924 --> 01:01:21,638
DON 'T . DON 'T CRY , HANS .

1043
01:01:21,662 --> 01:01:24,874
COME TO ME , MY LIEBCHEN .

1044
01:01:24,898 --> 01:01:27,677
DON 'T CRY .

1045
01:01:27,701 --> 01:01:30,513
DON 'T , HANS .

1046
01:01:30,537 --> 01:01:34,773
DON 'T CRY . I LOVE YOU .

1047
01:01:35,876 --> 01:01:38,376
I LOVE YOU .

1048
01:01:40,613 --> 01:01:43,592
CAPTIONING MADE POSSIBLE BY WARNER BROS .

